<name>Paris protests Sat 17 Oct (updated 10-17 07:15)</name>
<description>No agreed route yet. Undeclared gatherings are banned 07:00–22:00 across central Paris, from the Champs-Élysées to Bastille. The 14:00 rally at Bastille is still announced. Unofficial map built from press reports; check the Préfecture de police and RATP before travelling.</description>
<Style id="confirmed"><LineStyle><color>ff2c36d4</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>702c36d4</color></PolyStyle></Style>
<Style id="likely"><LineStyle><color>ff1a73e8</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>701a73e8</color></PolyStyle></Style>
