<Folder><name>Confirmed and likely</name>
<Placemark><name>Rally at Place de la Bastille (13:00–19:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 13:00–19:30<br><br>All organisers (Gilets Jaunes, Interfac IDF students, unions with CGT support) call for a rally here from 14:00. Expect crowds from early afternoon. The prefecture also lists Place de la Bastille among sectors where undeclared gatherings are banned from 07:00 to 22:00 (fine of 135 euros); the declared 14:00 rally is not reported as banned. One report says the departure may move to République.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353967-october-17-mobilization-what-route-will-the-demonstration-in-paris-take">Sortiraparis, updated 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-le-cortege-341287.html">Affiches Parisiennes, 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://fr.news.yahoo.com/sport/mobilisation-17-octobre-interdiction-manifester-205841271.html">Yahoo Actualités, banned sectors (night of 16 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://fr.news.yahoo.com/sport/17-octobre-pourquoi-l-organisation-121828151.html">Yahoo Actualités, why the route is stuck (16 Oct)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.374385,48.853201,0 2.374285,48.852531,0 2.373990,48.851886,0 2.373510,48.851292,0 2.372865,48.850771,0 2.372079,48.850344,0 2.371182,48.850026,0 2.370209,48.849830,0 2.369197,48.849764,0 2.368185,48.849830,0 2.367211,48.850026,0 2.366314,48.850344,0 2.365528,48.850771,0 2.364883,48.851292,0 2.364404,48.851886,0 2.364108,48.852531,0 2.364009,48.853201,0 2.364108,48.853871,0 2.364404,48.854516,0 2.364883,48.855110,0 2.365528,48.855631,0 2.366314,48.856058,0 2.367211,48.856376,0 2.368185,48.856572,0 2.369197,48.856638,0 2.370209,48.856572,0 2.371182,48.856376,0 2.372079,48.856058,0 2.372865,48.855631,0 2.373510,48.855110,0 2.373990,48.854516,0 2.374285,48.853871,0 2.374385,48.853201,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>March Bastille → République (Bd Beaumarchais) (14:30–19:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 14:30–19:30<br><br>Organisers want to march to République. The prefecture had not agreed a route on Friday evening.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353967-october-17-mobilization-what-route-will-the-demonstration-in-paris-take">Sortiraparis, updated 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-le-cortege-341287.html">Affiches Parisiennes, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.362796,48.865759,0 2.362030,48.866213,0 2.361630,48.866712,0 2.361549,48.867274,0 2.361798,48.867814,0 2.362341,48.868249,0 2.363093,48.868514,0 2.363942,48.868568,0 2.364757,48.868403,0 2.366204,48.867648,0 2.366782,48.867160,0 2.367098,48.866376,0 2.368787,48.863608,0 2.371016,48.854538,0 2.371399,48.854245,0 2.371748,48.853831,0 2.371900,48.853301,0 2.371807,48.852796,0 2.371443,48.852285,0 2.371156,48.852075,0 2.370425,48.851785,0 2.369582,48.851701,0 2.369158,48.851743,0 2.368388,48.851984,0 2.367309,48.852688,0 2.366954,48.853169,0 2.364728,48.862252,0 2.364490,48.862583,0 2.364401,48.863093,0 2.362796,48.865759,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>17 October 1961 memorial march from the Grand Rex (16:30–19:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 16:30–19:00<br><br>March for the 65th anniversary of 17 October 1961 starts at the Rex cinema (2nd arr.) at 16:30. The exact route is not published; the line shown is the usual way to Pont Saint-Michel.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.343000,48.854381,0 2.344492,48.855876,0 2.345746,48.857693,0 2.346182,48.857998,0 2.350739,48.866121,0 2.350783,48.866547,0 2.351069,48.866926,0 2.351310,48.867090,0 2.352006,48.868349,0 2.351444,48.868545,0 2.351022,48.868889,0 2.347286,48.869661,0 2.346712,48.869848,0 2.346477,48.869993,0 2.346157,48.870360,0 2.346073,48.870779,0 2.346238,48.871189,0 2.346626,48.871525,0 2.346887,48.871649,0 2.347492,48.871785,0 2.347813,48.871793,0 2.350206,48.871355,0 2.355130,48.870253,0 2.355632,48.869951,0 2.355905,48.869540,0 2.355904,48.869091,0 2.355763,48.868801,0 2.349236,48.857210,0 2.348864,48.856686,0 2.348483,48.856426,0 2.347348,48.854812,0 2.346141,48.853591,0 2.346202,48.853036,0 2.346109,48.852832,0 2.345755,48.852480,0 2.345224,48.852244,0 2.344916,48.852182,0 2.344277,48.852182,0 2.343448,48.852405,0 2.342914,48.852664,0 2.342580,48.853042,0 2.342498,48.853477,0 2.342680,48.853974,0 2.343000,48.854381,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Gathering at Pont Saint-Michel (18:00–20:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 18:00–20:30<br><br>Commemoration gathering at 18:30 (5th/6th arr.).<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.347599,48.853400,0 2.347541,48.853012,0 2.347370,48.852639,0 2.347092,48.852295,0 2.346719,48.851993,0 2.346264,48.851746,0 2.345744,48.851562,0 2.345181,48.851449,0 2.344595,48.851410,0 2.344009,48.851449,0 2.343446,48.851562,0 2.342926,48.851746,0 2.342471,48.851993,0 2.342098,48.852295,0 2.341820,48.852639,0 2.341649,48.853012,0 2.341592,48.853400,0 2.341649,48.853788,0 2.341820,48.854161,0 2.342098,48.854505,0 2.342471,48.854807,0 2.342926,48.855054,0 2.343446,48.855238,0 2.344009,48.855351,0 2.344595,48.855390,0 2.345181,48.855351,0 2.345744,48.855238,0 2.346264,48.855054,0 2.346719,48.854807,0 2.347092,48.854505,0 2.347370,48.854161,0 2.347541,48.853788,0 2.347599,48.853400,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Taxi protest at Porte Maillot (06:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 06:00–20:00<br><br>About 2,000 taxis rolling from Porte Maillot towards Roissy-CDG since Thursday. Road traffic to the airports may be slow; RER B is the alternative.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.288456,48.877999,0 2.288351,48.877293,0 2.288041,48.876615,0 2.287536,48.875989,0 2.286857,48.875441,0 2.286029,48.874991,0 2.285085,48.874657,0 2.284061,48.874451,0 2.282995,48.874381,0 2.281930,48.874451,0 2.280906,48.874657,0 2.279962,48.874991,0 2.279134,48.875441,0 2.278455,48.875989,0 2.277950,48.876615,0 2.277639,48.877293,0 2.277534,48.877999,0 2.277639,48.878705,0 2.277950,48.879383,0 2.278455,48.880009,0 2.279134,48.880557,0 2.279962,48.881007,0 2.280906,48.881341,0 2.281930,48.881547,0 2.282995,48.881616,0 2.284061,48.881547,0 2.285085,48.881341,0 2.286029,48.881007,0 2.286857,48.880557,0 2.287536,48.880009,0 2.288041,48.879383,0 2.288351,48.878705,0 2.288456,48.877999,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
