<Folder><name>Banned routes</name>
<Placemark><name>Banned route: Grands Boulevards to Concorde (13:00–21:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 13:00–21:00<br><br>The prefecture banned République → Concorde and Opéra → Bastille along the Grands Boulevards. A ban usually means heavy police presence, and unauthorised groups can still try to gather.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353967-october-17-mobilization-what-route-will-the-demonstration-in-paris-take">Sortiraparis, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.320332,48.864929,0 2.319662,48.865505,0 2.319306,48.866030,0 2.319266,48.866605,0 2.319369,48.866886,0 2.319549,48.867150,0 2.320083,48.867574,0 2.321999,48.870138,0 2.322278,48.870355,0 2.323506,48.871023,0 2.324359,48.871226,0 2.324813,48.871242,0 2.325612,48.871116,0 2.329835,48.871829,0 2.330308,48.872224,0 2.330677,48.872401,0 2.331534,48.872595,0 2.332438,48.872558,0 2.333081,48.872364,0 2.337279,48.873097,0 2.337792,48.873418,0 2.338629,48.873647,0 2.339082,48.873676,0 2.340120,48.873564,0 2.348478,48.872168,0 2.354081,48.870989,0 2.354674,48.870996,0 2.355118,48.870929,0 2.355533,48.870806,0 2.356031,48.870544,0 2.356725,48.870379,0 2.362082,48.869573,0 2.362769,48.869597,0 2.363214,48.869533,0 2.364006,48.869243,0 2.364323,48.869026,0 2.364738,48.868493,0 2.364820,48.868197,0 2.364718,48.867601,0 2.364537,48.867324,0 2.363766,48.866730,0 2.362865,48.866451,0 2.361871,48.866448,0 2.355549,48.867404,0 2.347428,48.869171,0 2.339968,48.870392,0 2.327230,48.868218,0 2.325467,48.867859,0 2.324273,48.866250,0 2.324259,48.865695,0 2.324124,48.865407,0 2.323614,48.864911,0 2.322857,48.864582,0 2.321968,48.864470,0 2.321081,48.864591,0 2.320332,48.864929,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Place de l'Opéra (original Gilets Jaunes start) (12:30–17:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 12:30–17:00<br><br>First announced as the Gilets Jaunes meeting point (speeches from 13:00), then banned. Some people may still turn up.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.335216,48.870999,0 2.335150,48.870558,0 2.334956,48.870134,0 2.334641,48.869743,0 2.334216,48.869400,0 2.333699,48.869119,0 2.333109,48.868910,0 2.332469,48.868782,0 2.331803,48.868738,0 2.331137,48.868782,0 2.330497,48.868910,0 2.329907,48.869119,0 2.329389,48.869400,0 2.328965,48.869743,0 2.328649,48.870134,0 2.328455,48.870558,0 2.328390,48.870999,0 2.328455,48.871440,0 2.328649,48.871864,0 2.328965,48.872255,0 2.329389,48.872598,0 2.329907,48.872879,0 2.330497,48.873088,0 2.331137,48.873217,0 2.331803,48.873260,0 2.332469,48.873217,0 2.333109,48.873088,0 2.333699,48.872879,0 2.334216,48.872598,0 2.334641,48.872255,0 2.334956,48.871864,0 2.335150,48.871440,0 2.335216,48.870999,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Gatherings banned: Champs-Élysées and Concorde (07:00–22:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 07:00–22:00<br><br>The prefecture banned undeclared gatherings on the Champs-Élysées and Place de la Concorde from 07:00 to 22:00 (fine of 135 euros). A Gilets Jaunes march had been requested here. Expect heavy police presence.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://fr.news.yahoo.com/sport/mobilisation-17-octobre-interdiction-manifester-205841271.html">Yahoo Actualités, banned sectors (night of 16 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-plusieurs-secteurs-interdits-par-la-prefecture-341317.html">Affiches Parisiennes (AFP), banned sectors, 16 Oct 19:31</a> · <a href="https://www.jeanmarcmorandini.com/article-655004-inquietude-pour-le-17-octobre-la-prefecture-interdit-ce-soir-de-manifester-dans-plusieurs-secteurs-de-paris-mais-surtout-autour-de-l-elysee-et-matignon-mais-aussi-la-place-de-la-concorde.html">Jean-Marc Morandini, banned sectors, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.296557,48.875257,0 2.298030,48.874837,0 2.310293,48.870943,0 2.310973,48.870864,0 2.311477,48.870716,0 2.312348,48.870274,0 2.320314,48.867739,0 2.322075,48.867254,0 2.322916,48.866821,0 2.323444,48.866208,0 2.323577,48.865508,0 2.323296,48.864827,0 2.322643,48.864270,0 2.321717,48.863920,0 2.321195,48.863842,0 2.320132,48.863892,0 2.318631,48.864261,0 2.296027,48.871454,0 2.295030,48.871363,0 2.294103,48.871443,0 2.293485,48.871585,0 2.292881,48.871827,0 2.292098,48.872341,0 2.291750,48.872724,0 2.291489,48.873179,0 2.291392,48.873739,0 2.291441,48.874253,0 2.291926,48.875044,0 2.292278,48.875329,0 2.292709,48.875560,0 2.293202,48.875729,0 2.293737,48.875829,0 2.294290,48.875855,0 2.294840,48.875806,0 2.295364,48.875684,0 2.296557,48.875257,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Gatherings banned: around the Élysée and Interior Ministry (07:00–22:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 07:00–22:00<br><br>Undeclared gatherings are banned around the Élysée, the Interior Ministry and nearby sites from 07:00 to 22:00. The exact perimeter was not published; the circle is an approximation.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://fr.news.yahoo.com/sport/mobilisation-17-octobre-interdiction-manifester-205841271.html">Yahoo Actualités, banned sectors (night of 16 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-plusieurs-secteurs-interdits-par-la-prefecture-341317.html">Affiches Parisiennes (AFP), banned sectors, 16 Oct 19:31</a> · <a href="https://www.jeanmarcmorandini.com/article-655004-inquietude-pour-le-17-octobre-la-prefecture-interdit-ce-soir-de-manifester-dans-plusieurs-secteurs-de-paris-mais-surtout-autour-de-l-elysee-et-matignon-mais-aussi-la-place-de-la-concorde.html">Jean-Marc Morandini, banned sectors, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.321700,48.870800,0 2.321621,48.870271,0 2.321388,48.869762,0 2.321010,48.869293,0 2.320500,48.868882,0 2.319880,48.868544,0 2.319172,48.868294,0 2.318403,48.868139,0 2.317604,48.868087,0 2.316805,48.868139,0 2.316037,48.868294,0 2.315329,48.868544,0 2.314708,48.868882,0 2.314199,48.869293,0 2.313820,48.869762,0 2.313587,48.870271,0 2.313509,48.870800,0 2.313587,48.871329,0 2.313820,48.871838,0 2.314199,48.872307,0 2.314708,48.872719,0 2.315329,48.873056,0 2.316037,48.873307,0 2.316805,48.873461,0 2.317604,48.873513,0 2.318403,48.873461,0 2.319172,48.873307,0 2.319880,48.873056,0 2.320500,48.872719,0 2.321010,48.872307,0 2.321388,48.871838,0 2.321621,48.871329,0 2.321700,48.870800,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
