<Folder><name>Métro stations that may close</name>
<Placemark><name>Métro Bastille (may close)</name><description>Lines 1, 5, 8. The Préfecture de police decides closures on the day, with little warning. Stations near Opéra, République, Bastille and Concorde are the most exposed. The ones marked are those named for a Bastille → République march, plus Opéra and Concorde. No official list has been published, and the ban sectors also cover Paris train stations.</description><styleUrl>#station</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>2.369197,48.853201,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
